sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Pengguna (User)
    participant Flutter as Aplikasi Flutter<br/>(Layar & Provider)
    participant FastAPI as Backend FastAPI<br/>(app/api/pre_purchase)
    participant MLEngine as ML Risk Service<br/>(app/services/pre_purchase_risk)
    participant Database as PostgreSQL<br/>(Supabase Cloud)

    %% 1. Input dan Cek Risiko
    User->>Flutter: Input rencana belanja (nominal, kategori, merchant)
    Flutter->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/pre-purchase/check
    FastAPI->>Database: Ambil riwayat belanja, pagu anggaran, target tabungan
    Database-->>FastAPI: Data konteks keuangan pengguna
    FastAPI->>MLEngine: extract_features() & predict() (7 fitur kontekstual)
    MLEngine-->>FastAPI: Hasil inferensi (skor risiko, risk_level, trigger_factors)
    FastAPI->>Database: Simpan log evaluasi awal (pre_purchase_checks, risk_predictions)
    FastAPI-->>Flutter: Return PrePurchaseCheckResponse (skor, XAI, dampak, check_id)
    Flutter-->>User: Tampilkan PrePurchaseResultScreen (peringatan, dampak, 3 tombol aksi)

    %% 2. Pengambilan Keputusan
    alt Pilihan PROCEED (Lanjut Belanja)
        User->>Flutter: Tekan tombol 'Beli Sekarang (Sadar Risiko)'
        Flutter->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/pre-purchase/decide (decision='PROCEED')
        FastAPI->>Database: UPDATE pre_purchase_checks SET user_decision='PROCEED'
        FastAPI-->>Flutter: Status RECORDED
        User->>Flutter: Catat pengeluaran riil di Form Transaksi
        Flutter->>Database: INSERT into transactions (amount, category, tag)
    else Pilihan ADJUST (Sesuaikan Nominal)
        User->>Flutter: Tekan tombol 'Sesuaikan Nominal' (input nominal baru)
        Flutter->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/pre-purchase/decide (decision='ADJUST', adjusted_amount)
        FastAPI->>Database: UPDATE pre_purchase_checks SET user_decision='ADJUST'
        FastAPI-->>Flutter: Status RECORDED
    else Pilihan POSTPONE (Tunda Belanja)
        User->>Flutter: Tekan tombol 'Tunda Dulu (Jeda 72 Jam)'
        Flutter->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/pre-purchase/decide (decision='POSTPONE')
        FastAPI->>Database: UPDATE pre_purchase_checks SET user_decision='POSTPONE'
        FastAPI-->>Flutter: Status RECORDED
    end

    %% 3. Konfirmasi Pasca-Keputusan (Feedback Ground Truth)
    opt Konfirmasi Pasca-Keputusan Berkala
        User->>Flutter: Konfirmasi kepuasan (terencana / impulsif disesali)
        Flutter->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/pre-purchase/feedback (was_impulsive, rating)
        FastAPI->>Database: INSERT into post_decision_feedbacks (check_id, was_impulsive)
        FastAPI-->>Flutter: Feedback berhasil disimpan
    end
